 codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847420/extras/d9933147724e17c2fb6c682941a52dad.mp4?t=1744031236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Diverse Enemies: Battle against a multitude of foes, from rampaging peasants and formidable knights to dark mages and ticked-off cows! Each enemy has weaknesses and strengths, so plan your defense accordingly.<br><br>Trap Placement: Lay down traps along enemy paths to hinder their progress and inflict damage upon them, from spikes to flames, take advantage of these powerful allies.<br><br>Powerful Spells: Unleash devastating spells like Ice Storms and Lightning Strikes to turn the tide of battle in your favor, but watch out, just like your gold and HP, mana can be stolen from you if you let the enemies in!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847420/extras/7b75a5ba7c4d84cf7e394988a3663d3c.poster.avif?t=1744031236\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847420/extras/7b75a5ba7c4d84cf7e394988a3663d3c.webm?t=1744031236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847420/extras/7b75a5ba7c4d84cf7e394988a3663d3c.mp4?t=1744031236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Skill Development: Level up and choose from a range of skills to enhance your strategic prowess and combat effectiveness.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847420/extras/e5275b0d3c6e288ee965a6d380442a16.poster.avif?t=1744031236\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847420/extras/e5275b0d3c6e288ee965a6d380442a16.webm?t=1744031236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847420/extras/e5275b0d3c6e288ee965a6d380442a16.mp4?t=1744031236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Medal Rewards: Earn prestigious medals based on your performance in each mission, from Iron to Epic Gold.<br><br>Immersive Gameplay: Control the speed of the game to suit your preferences and stay vigilant against the varied bases of enemy departure.<br><br>Prepare yourself, General, for a battle of wits and magic against the forces of darkness. The fate of the kingdom rests in your hands. Will you rise to the challenge and emerge victorious, or will the islands fall into darkness? Only you can decide in King Towers!<br><br><br><br><strong>Developer Note: </strong><br><br>This game is a 2010 artefact developed by a small indie team using the full potential and limitations of flash technology. We apologize for any technical problems or inconveniences you may encounter in your playthrough, including issues with the game\u2019s texts. We hope that with these limitations in mind, you may still enjoy the experience!",
